        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "          112 Kaganv Tingsaengcna Amaan the Poubauhmei",
            "                                11.8.8.9. Ref. 9. 9. 9. 10",
            "          Doh hei D",
            "",
            "          1. Kaganv tingsaengcna amaan the Poubauhmei.",
            "             Theic nuhpui bamv khourui duakna,",
            "             Nang mei khang laalou dat pw o,",
            "             Nang riw akhou tiikeylou dat ro.",
            "",
            "                      He Poubauhmei ata 'zianloumei,",
            "                      Ch'ryn e Nang ramrianraa khaengvloumei!",
            "                      Nang ringcbamv tiilou o Poubauhmei.",
            "                      Apumc lev abumaengc Nang khang tii the.",
            "",
            "          2. Ntaw thu ai Nang khang di the Poubauhmei.",
            "             Nang rui ryanraaloupui zaengrui,",
            "             Ningtow pwkhou mikdui keyna,",
            "             Poubauhmei, Poubauhmei twna huay.",
            "",
            "          3. 'Khavloumei maekmei Poubauhmei Jisu ta,",
            "             Kros ruc khou thaengclou bam khoutei,",
            "             Zoukhiangc dui tei Kakhou duylou;",
            "             Poubauhmei tarimei kim mak ge.",
            "",
            "          4. Tingsaeng Zion ramc tinggaancpatpui nungc kiu,",
            "             Kawmei bianggun khwan chu pwkhou,",
            "             Tingkauh ramc khou guang dat lana,",
            "             Lu rui Nang ta thuanc ni Poubauhmei."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
